# Catch It If You Can (windurst 21): Ohruru (Port Windurst; no default action; his standard 230 is his script's else).
# Available: 230 (var 1), 253 (var 2), 231, option 0: begun (any option). Accepted, no Mute / Bane / Plague: 248 or 251
# (math.randomInt, the seeded script RNG). Mute (a GM's effect): 246, option 1: nothing; option 0: needToZone, Mute
# taken, 1000 gil, var 0, completed, fame 10. Completed with needToZone: 255. Bane alone: 246 (before needToZone),
# option 0: Bane taken, 1200 gil, fame 10 (no completion). Mute, Bane and Plague together: 246 three times, each finish
# taking the first of Mute / Bane / Plague (1000, 1200, 1500). Rezoned: completed, Wonder Wands available: his standard
# 230; Wonder Wands completed (GM): 265; Wonder Wands accepted (GM): 258 (0, 17053). Accepted again (GMs), Wonder Wands
# completed: this quest's arms first (248 / 251); Wonder Wands accepted: 258 before this quest's arms; accepted with
# needToZone (a GM's flag): 255.
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-105.0,-4.25,92.7 job=WAR lvl=75
login
